Begin your music career with Music Band!

Music Band is an easy-to-use music maker app. In the hood of this app you can use everything you need to play music — drums, bass, keys, vocoder and many more. And it’s very simple to create — drag and drop samples on track grid, play and pause when you need it, and apply any effects to achieve your desired sounds. 


MUSIC BAND FEATURES:

— Music Band looks and sounds solid: like expensive production studio in your hands;
— Library of unique and eccentric soundtracks, where you can pick your favorites to get started. Let’s play cool mixes with Hip-hop, EDM, House, Dubstep, Drum & Bass, Trap, Electronic elements;
— It’s easy to play — try our unique technology that lets you fit all the sounds together with perfection;
— Try our amazing effects: such as flanger, EQ, tremolo, distortion and chorus;
Record your creations and let your friends and family be inspired and impressed by your DJing talents.

Become a Star DJ with Music Band!
